	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama! Time is a-wasting!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Kotone dashes along the shoreline, turning to wave excitedly at me.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"With the scorching midsummer sun beating down on us, there really was no better day for us to go to the beach.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's no rush, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Days where we can be together like this are hard to come by, so we absolutely must enjoy ourselves to the fullest!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Indeed, the Exalt-Priestess's work is never done.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Between presiding over rituals, conducting holy rites, and organizing public festivities, it's almost a miracle she was allowed to have today all to herself.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“More importantly, Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is that all you have to say after laying your eyes on me?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Say what now?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is not every day that your lovely wife shows off her swimsuit to you, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Kotone smugly declares, striking a pose.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Her ample breasts strain against the sheer fabric of her swimsuit, threatening to spill over.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahem, my eyes are up here...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Kotone shrinks into herself as a blush spreads across her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Even though I've done a lot more to her body than simply stare, being ogled like this must still be embarrassing for her.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though perhaps you can allow your eyes to wander a little. Well, what do you think?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It suits you well, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This time, with feeling!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's really easy on the eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“So close!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"What does she want from me?",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“'My midsummer night's dream is you, my dear.' 'Did Oomikami send me my very own swimsuit angel?' Those are the sort of lines I wanted to hear!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You shouldn't expect a warrior to be so honey-tongued.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What's more important to you, being a warrior, or being my man?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mgh.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Neither answer is going to work out in my favor.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The only winning move is to change the subject.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've been wondering, Kotone, doesn't this beach seem awfully empty?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, do you really take me for such a fool? Still, I suppose I shall let you off the hook this time.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, this land is being held in trust by the Imperial Temple. Only authorized personnel are permitted entry.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it really all right for us to be here, then?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do not worry, I know of plenty of priestesses who make it a routine to come here and relax after a hard day's work.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Huh. I suppose being a priestess does have its perks.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Anyway, Soujin-sama, let us play to our heart's content! Time is a-wasting, after all!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Kotone reaches into her handbag and, with a flourish, pulls out a strange, shriveled object.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's that? Dried squid?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Certainly not. This is a marvelous object known as a ≪beach ball.≫”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It simply needs to be blown up like so...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I see, so it needs to be inflated first.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Positioning the air plug in front of her mouth, Kotone takes a deep breath and begins to blow into it.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Phwee... Phweee...”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Phweee─ack, *cough, cough!* Haah... fwaah...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, phew... S-Soujin-sama, I leave the rest to you...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Yeah, that's probably for the best.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Despite her valiant efforts, the beach ball still isn't inflated in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"When I put the ball up to my face, however, Kotone lets out an embarrassed giggle.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, we just shared an indirect kiss, did we not?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I mean, we've kissed plenty of times for real already.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Gosh, this and that are wholly separate matters!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You really do not have even the slightest sense of romance...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Kotone flashes me a disgruntled scowl, heaving a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I pretend not to notice, instead focusing my attention on dispatching the foe before me.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whoa, now that is a warrior for you!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This isn't anything to be impressed by.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kotone jogs a dozen or so paces away as I smile wryly to myself.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-samaaa! Hit it over heeere!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Kotone raises her hands overhead, ready to receive it.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Ah, so you're meant to hit the beach ball with each other.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, here I go.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I look forward to receiving all of your love!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"What on earth is she talking about?",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hup!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Well, whatever. I wind up and hit the ball directly towards Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Uwaaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Kotone ducks for dear life, and the ball sails past where her head just was an instant ago.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh? Are we supposed to dodge the ball, then?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not at all! Hit it like you are not trying to kill me!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I swear, I saw my life flash before my eyes...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"She huffily stamps her feet with a pout.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“See? Just like... this!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Kotone picks up the beach ball and taps it lightly with her hand.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"It sails in a gentle arc through the air.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like this?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Mimicking her, I bump the ball back in her direction.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, that is more like it!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I get it now. Seems like this could be fun.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"We continue gently passing the ball back and forth a few times.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"But unused to having to hold my strength back so much, I accidentally send the ball flying wide.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, oops.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Got it!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Kotone immediately rushes after it, her feet pattering against the soft sand.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"My attention is inadvertently drawn in by two other bouncy orbs set simultaneously into motion.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee! A nice save, was it not?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uh, yeah, nice one.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I somehow manage to tear my eyes away from Kotone's chest.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"No good. I can't be losing my composure right now.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Turning my focus back to the airborne beach ball, I gently hit it back towards Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"But perhaps owing to my distraction, it once again goes sailing wide.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“M-My bad!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not on my watch!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Kotone saves the ball with another spectacular dive.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"But the motion very nearly sends her breasts spilling out from the tight confines of her swimsuit top.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Truly, a sight for sore eyes indeed.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"...Wait, what am I even thinking?",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“S-Soujin-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"With an audible “Boing!”, a certain object bounces off the top of my head.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"A familiar beach ball proceeds to roll to a rest at my feet.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Pfft... Heheh!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahahahaha! Th-The sound it made... when the beach ball...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...How negligent.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Distracted by Kotone's breasts, I shamefully lost sight of my surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee... 'Boing!', even though you were as expressionless as usual...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahahaha! I-I can't...! My belly hurts from laughing too much... ahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it really that funny?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, hah... I-I mean, I have never seen you quite like that!”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I doubt anyone else has ever seen you make such a fool of yourself... Ehehee!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Trying and failing to hold herself back, Kotone continues giggling uncontrollably at my expense.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd appreciate it if you'd keep this between us.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm, whateeever shall I do?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It might prove awfully hard to not let my tongue slip in front of the other priestesses...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Kotone muses with an impish grin on her face.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I've met more than my fair share of gossip-hungry priestesses during my visits to the Imperial Temple...",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case... I'll just have to make sure you stay silent!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Kyaah! Soujin-sama is going to seal my lips!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Raising an excited shriek, Kotone dashes off towards the surf.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Despite her apparent consternation, she nonetheless finds time to sneak several expectant peeks in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Well, I suppose I should play the part she expects of me.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Once I make up my mind, it hardly takes any time at all for me to catch up to her at the water’s edge.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you really think you could outrun a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahaha, what an impious warrior you are, to lay your hands on the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In the name of Oomikami, I will punish you!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Kotone sends a splash of seawater flying in my direction─",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Which I effortlessly sidestep.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Engaging a warrior in close combat is a fool's errand.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mmrgh... I suppose I have no choice... but to take you down with me!”",
