		[167]={
			{
"I immediately dive into the ocean to fulfill my swimsuit retrieval mission.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"All the while, thinking exceedingly worthless thoughts like, “It’s been a few days since Kotone and I have been intimate with each other, hasn’t it?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haahh, what a near disaster that was...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Kotone lets out a relieved sigh as she adjusts her swimsuit top for the second time today.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At least we were able to get your swimsuit back.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you had noticed any later, it would surely have been swept out to sea.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Though I daresay you would have preferred precisely such an outcome.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you mean by that?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehehee, did you think I failed to notice you staring at my chest all day long?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You knew this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It could hardly be more obvious, the way you were practically undressing me with your eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Her unimpressed revelation of my indiscretions leaves me speechless.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, I won't do it again.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well, I did not exactly find it unpleasant...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If anything... the thought that you coveted my body filled my heart with warmth.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Kotone's voice drops down to a sultry murmur as she snuggles into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You’re a bad man, Soujin-sama... lusting after this innocent priestess...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Wantonly pressing her ample breasts against me, she whispers this into my ear.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Her upturned eyes are swimming with passion.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, what do you have to say for yourself, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you come on to me like that, you know what I'm gonna do, right?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...I do.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would not refuse you, no matter what you might do...”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"As we stare into each other's eyes, Kotone's cheeks flush with desire, her breaths growing hot and heavy.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Someone might see us if we were to do it here.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Rest assured, this beach is very safe from prying eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, days like this are hard to come by... so would it not be a shame if we did not enjoy ourselves to the fullest?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I seem to recall her expressing a similar sentiment when we first arrived here.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"But now, her words are laced with a very different meaning.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I... have been diligent in keeping up my studies, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs, gently tracing her fingers over my body.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You have been looking forward to this all day, have you not?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Come, right this way...”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Kotone whispers seductively, leading me by the hand to the secluded rest area where we laid down our belongings.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I allow myself to be pulled along, no longer of any mind to resist her advances.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Awfully feisty today, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehee, I simply could not help it, seeing how desperate you looked.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And I thought that it might perhaps make you desire me all the more.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What, you think I haven't been showing you enough love?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wish for even more. Enough that you only have eyes for me and no one else.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Kotone's voice trails off into a whisper as she bashfully averts her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What're you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...You seemed awfully pleased the other day when all those priestesses were fawning over you.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"So she saw that?",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"True, when I went to visit Kotone at the Imperial Temple the other day, I was accosted by several priestesses at the reception gate.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"And it's certainly possible that just like she says, I looked like I was enjoying myself.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is it not perfectly natural that your wife should feel some jealousy?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Kotone scowls at me with puffed-up cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're probably right that I was wearing an unseemly smile back then.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But that's only because I was telling them all about you.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Those girls couldn't get enough of my stories about Her\nEminence's life as a newlywed.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They've always been so concerned about their beloved\nExalt-Priestess's happiness.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-Is that really so?!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Kotone's mouth hangs wide open at this unexpected revelation.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How could I jump to conclusions so quickly... please forgive me, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, now that's the Kotone I know and love.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I don't want her to change a thing, including the adorable way she gets jealous so easily.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That said, don't you think it's only right for you to make it up to me?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-What do you intend to have me do?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't have to do anything. I'll show you just how much I love you.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"After being denied by her for so long, my wicked desire to have my way with Kotone's body rears its ugly head.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Without another word, I pick her up and effortlessly hoist her into my lap.",
			},
