		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mmhh... I suppose I can live with that...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There is still plenty of time left before the sun goes down, so I will back down for now.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But... just know that I am not nearly satisfied yet.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Kotone coyly whispers in my ear with a seductive smile.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Well, it seems like today is going to be an awfully busy day indeed.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, I was meaning to ask you, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You mentioned that the priestesses were asking about our married life, but what exactly did you tell them?”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, you know, the way you'd beg me for kisses first thing every morning, or the culinary disasters you'd subject me to for dinner every night.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whaaat?! How could you besmirch my good name just like that?!”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All the girls were giggling and nodding along, though.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-Huh...?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Kotone tilts her head quizzically as she works through the implication.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Of course, all the priestesses have nothing but the utmost respect for their Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"But at the same time, to them, Kotone is a down-to-earth figure they can good-naturedly poke fun at.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Not only does Kotone possess “the gift to love unconditionally,” she is able to bring out that same virtue in everyone she comes into contact with.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Auuuh... At this rate, I'll never command the same reverence my predecessor once did.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I love you just the way you are.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, you think you have me all figured out, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Kotone puffs out her cheeks sulkily.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"But she isn't able to keep it up for long before a smile begins to spread across her lips.",
			},
